<title>USA: NYCE certificated cotton stocks flat at 181,230.</title>
<headline>NYCE certificated cotton stocks flat at 181,230.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of June 16 totaled 181,230 bales, unchanged from the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, no cancellations, 7,817 decertification orders, and 1,069 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
